                            "body": {
                                "type": "TextualBody",
                                "value": "<span><p><b>[Header]</b><br/>\nSTATE<br/>\nAGRICULTURAL AND MECHANICAL COLLEGE<br/>\nOF TEXAS.<br/>\nBryan, ___________________ 187</p>\n\n<p>Faculty is adopted for the next session, there<br/>\nwill be students in all branches of the depart-<br/>\nment and a sufficient outfit for practical<br/>\ninstruction will be a necessity. I am aware of the<br/>\nfact that the College is at present unable to<br/>\nsupply these very urgent wants; but should an<br/>\nappropriation be made by the legislature for the<br/>\nCollege, I would recommend that the department<br/>\nbe put in a condition which would enable the pro-<br/>\nfessor to impart thorough and practical instruction<br/>\nin all its branches.</p>\n\n<p><b>[Signature]</b><br/>\nRespectfully<br/>\nYour obedient Servant,<br/>\nR. P. W. Morris<br/>\nProf. Nat. Phil. &amp; Engineering.</p></span>",
